 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >这是一款通过搜打撤玩法收集资源来推进家园建设的冒险种田游戏。你将扮演开拓者，带领你的专属女仆米娅，踏上荒野，建造村庄、招募伙伴、探索随机生成的冒险地图，通过一次次冒险创造专属于你的繁荣领地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/abc458a6634c6f4230a48b91220d7a70.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/abc458a6634c6f4230a48b91220d7a70.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/abc458a6634c6f4230a48b91220d7a70.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【游戏特色】</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>永不重复的战术撤离</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >每次踏入森林，都将面对随机生成的地图与未知事件。挥舞亲手锻造的武器，击败敌人，探索资源、发掘稀有宝藏，在贪心与稳妥之间决策，将建造资源和珍贵的战利品安全带回村庄。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/0e72cf4a38af5e758df604442dac0a18.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/0e72cf4a38af5e758df604442dac0a18.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/0e72cf4a38af5e758df604442dac0a18.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>打造你的梦幻据点</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >利用探索带回的资源，从零开始建设属于你的村庄。建造工房、仓库等设施，加工资源、打造装备、酿造美酒，为下一次冒险做好准备。随着建筑不断完善，伙伴们将在我们亲手打造的家园中生活、工作，让遗落的领地再次焕发生机。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/59a544839a2ae33ead18b14bef28d62e.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/59a544839a2ae33ead18b14bef28d62e.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/59a544839a2ae33ead18b14bef28d62e.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>结交伙伴建立羁绊</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >随着领地的扩张，你将遇到性格狂野的神奇伙伴：害怕兔兔的佣兵少女、过往神秘的木匠小哥、有着特殊战斗癖好的骑士……招募这些拥有独立战斗风格和工作专长的伙伴，他们不仅会与你一起冒险，还会成为你的牛马，在村庄中承担耕种、浇水、畜牧、采集等等重要工作，与你共同建设家园。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/d864bace8b88b1232770721ea180c23f.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>治愈系赛璐璐世界</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >小心，不要被画风骗了！明快的赛璐璐画风将紧张的探索与撤离过程包裹在童话绘本般的世界中，但这并不代表这个世界看起来就那么安全……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/fa87ff3618c8cfc2977199815aab6053.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/fa87ff3618c8cfc2977199815aab6053.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/fa87ff3618c8cfc2977199815aab6053.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>揭开失落文明的秘密</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >为何曾经人类与魔物和谐共处的城镇会化为废墟？随着探索不断深入，你将在冒险中收集文献、修复遗迹，逐步揭开这片土地与失落文明背后的真相。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/af704c3f21e55d889981c7c24aa91fde.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/af704c3f21e55d889981c7c24aa91fde.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/af704c3f21e55d889981c7c24aa91fde.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>冒险难度自定义</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >根据自己的喜好自由选择冒险难度吧。从轻松探索到硬核挑战，不同难度拥有不同的风险体验，总有一个梯度适合你今天的心情！就让我们再来一轮！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/1fbba017c97b3f6c54247b88818e729b.poster.avif?t=1788421222\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/1fbba017c97b3f6c54247b88818e729b.webm?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4829780/extras/1fbba017c97b3f6c54247b88818e729b.mp4?t=1788421222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
